// NODE_LABELS: the caption printed beside a hazard skull, radiation belt,
// aerobrake or lander-burn node, keyed by the node's SERVER slug (id2), e.g.
// 'dust storm', 'contact binary', 'sulfur geyser'. Nodes the board prints no
// caption for are absent.
// MAP_LABELS: every other printed label (cluster / region names, Lagrange
// names, flyby captions; `zone` = the heliocentric zone name + its number; `note` = a yellow printed
// rule block, `\n` breaks its lines as the board does), placed where the board prints it. nx / ny
// are normalised board coordinates (the same space as the planner's node x / y),
// angle is the text baseline in degrees (0 = left to right, -90 = bottom to top),
// size is the printed cap height as a fraction of the board width.
// Pure data: no DOM, no node: imports.
